<div class="wrap">
  <div class="brand">🏛️ Bonds <span class="gn">&amp; Bond Health</span></div>
  <p class="lead">{{ t('The world\'s largest market, read end to end: the US curve, credit, real rates, rates-vol and funding plumbing (health first); a directional Duration & Curve Compass; the G10 + EM Global Sovereign Scorecard; and the measured map of how bonds transmit to equities, sectors, the dollar, gold, copper, oil and bitcoin. The same machinery that feeds the cross-asset synthesis. Context, not trade calls.', '世界最大的市场，端到端解读：美国收益率曲线、信用、实际利率、利率波动与资金管道（以健康为先）；方向性的久期与曲线罗盘；G10+新兴市场的全球主权记分卡；以及债券如何传导至股票、板块、美元、黄金、铜、原油与比特币的实测图谱。同一套机制为跨资产综合分析供数。仅作背景，非交易建议。') }}
